# 🍂 The Last Leaf — Week 11–12

[← Back to the main journal](../../README.md)

Expressive Mechanics · <your name>

*The Last Leaf* is a kinetic installation. A real leaf on a hinged branch gently breathes. When a
visitor holds a hand near the sensor, the leaf drops. The screen goes dark, a sketched leaf
appears, and the visitor paints it in the air with hand tracking. As the painted area grows, a
servo winds the real leaf back up, and the painted leaf joins the tree on screen.

Each entry follows the same pattern: **goal → what I did → decisions and why → problems and
iteration → next**.

